{"name":"Hayloft","hex":"#cdba96","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hayloft","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The upper storey of a barn used for storing hay."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hayloft"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hayloft","blocks":[{"text":"A hayloft is a space above a barn, stable or cow-shed, traditionally used for storage of hay or other fodder for the animals below. Haylofts were used mainly before the widespread use of very large hay bales, which allow simpler handling of bulk hay."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Chereshovitsa-hayloft.jpg/330px-Chereshovitsa-hayloft.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayloft","wikidata":"Q4416269"},{"title":"Hayloft (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Hayloft\", later re-released as \"Hayloft I\", is a 2008 song by Canadian indie rock band Mother Mother. It is the eighth song from their second studio album, O My Heart. The song tells the story of two young lovers unsuccessfully attempting to hide from the armed father of one of the pair. It did not find commercial success upon release, but attracted attention twelve years later from users on TikTok. The belated success of \"Hayloft\" led Mother Mother to release \"Hayloft II\", a sequel song that concludes the story."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayloft_(song)","wikidata":"Q120467717"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png/500px-Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png/1280px-Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png/500px-Desperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Desperate Conflict in a Barn, 1853. Haylofts were used to hide escaped slaves on the Underground Railroad.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADesperate_Conflict_in_a_Barn.png"}],"sounds":{"hayloft":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-hayloft.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-hayloft.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-hayloft.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-hayloft.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-hayloft.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"1995 UAZ 2206 beige rear","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg/500px-1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg","ratio":1.2959381044487428,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1995_UAZ_2206_beige_rear.jpg","share":0.2025},{"title":"Hyundai Kona Hybrid Inspiration SX2 HEV Beige Color Package (8)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Package_%288%29.jpg/500px-Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Package_%288%29.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hyundai_Kona_Hybrid_Inspiration_SX2_HEV_Beige_Color_Package_(8).jpg","share":0.143125},{"title":"Clcam d'Athiémé au Bénin 04","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Clcam_d%27Athi%C3%A9m%C3%A9_au_B%C3%A9nin_04.jpg/500px-Clcam_d%27Athi%C3%A9m%C3%A9_au_B%C3%A9nin_04.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Clcam_d%27Athi%C3%A9m%C3%A9_au_B%C3%A9nin_04.jpg","share":0.134375},{"title":"Hyunda